# Source of truth. Compile to requirements-serve.txt WITH HASHES:
#   uv pip compile --generate-hashes --python-version 3.11 --python-platform x86_64-manylinux_2_28 -o requirements-serve.txt requirements-serve.in
# Commit both files. The lock file is what makes the build reproducible.
#
# Deliberately smaller than requirements.txt: no mlflow, no training-only deps. The
# service loads the model via adapter.download() (google-cloud-storage) + joblib, never
# via mlflow's own model registry.
